{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "6f3a2e2a-2f3b-4b0a-9a1a-6c1e2b7d0f11",
    "name": "Remote.Shell.Interrupt",
    "description": "REST API for the Remote.Shell.Interrupt network monitoring platform (SNMP polling + billing sync). Covers every controller/action in the API as of the current codebase.\n\n## Getting started\n\n1. Run the API — either `dotnet run --project src/Remote.Shell.Interrupt.Storehouse/Remote.Shell.Interrupt.Storehouse.API` or `docker compose up -d` (see the repo README). Default: `http://localhost:5000`.\n2. Set the `baseUrl` collection variable if you're not using the default (it already points at `http://localhost:5000/api/v1`).\n3. Run **Auth > Login** with the seeded dev admin (`admin@localhost.local` / `Admin#Dev-Only-2025`, see README). Its test script auto-saves the returned `token`/`refreshToken` into the `accessToken`/`refreshToken` collection variables.\n4. Every other request inherits Bearer auth from the collection using `{{accessToken}}` — nothing else to configure. Endpoints marked (anonymous) below opt out of that via their own `noauth` setting.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Every endpoint requires authentication by default (global fallback policy) except the ones explicitly marked `[AllowAnonymous]` in code — these are called out per-request below.\n- Routes follow `api/v1/{controller}/{action}` (see `BaseAPIController`), not the REST-conventional `{controller}/{id}` shape.\n- `GetXByFilter` endpoints share the same `RequestParameters` query shape: `pageNumber`, `pageSize`, `orderBy`, `orderByDescending`, and repeatable `Filters[n].PropertyPath` / `Filters[n].Operator` / `Filters[n].Value` triples. Valid operators: Equals, NotEquals, GreaterThan, LessThan, Contains, Word, StartsWith, EndsWith, In.\n- The `SNMPExecutor` and `NetworkDevices > CreateNetworkDevice` examples target `192.168.101.8` with community `public` — that's the simulated router from `docker-compose.snmp.yml` (see `SnmpSimulator/README.md`). Point them at a real device instead if you're not using the simulator.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "packages": {}, "exec": [""] }
    },
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "packages": {}, "exec": [""] }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:5000/api/v1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "rootUrl", "value": "http://localhost:5000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminEmail", "value": "admin@localhost.local", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminPassword", "value": "Admin#Dev-Only-2025", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "simulatorHost", "value": "192.168.101.8", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "simulatorCommunity", "value": "public", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n    \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Auth/Login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Auth", "Login"]
            },
            "description": "Anonymous. Returns a JWT access token + refresh token. On success, saves both into collection variables so every other request in this collection is authenticated automatically."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (body.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.token);",
                  "    if (body.refreshToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', body.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "RefreshToken",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Auth/RefreshToken",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Auth", "RefreshToken"]
            },
            "description": "Anonymous. Exchanges the refresh token for a new access token + a new (rotated) refresh token; the old refresh token stops working. Updates the collection variables on success."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (body.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.token);",
                  "    if (body.refreshToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', body.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "RevokeToken",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Auth/RevokeToken",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Auth", "RevokeToken"]
            },
            "description": "Anonymous. Revokes a refresh token immediately (JWT-flow logout). Always returns 200 whether or not the token existed."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"new.user@example.com\",\n    \"password\": \"ChangeMe#123\",\n    \"role\": \"User\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Auth/Register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Auth", "Register"]
            },
            "description": "Admin only. `role` must be \"Admin\" or \"User\"."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "CookieLogin",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n    \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\",\n    \"isPersistent\": false\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Auth/CookieLogin",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Auth", "CookieLogin"]
            },
            "description": "Anonymous. Establishes an HttpOnly cookie session (browser-style auth) instead of a Bearer token; Postman's cookie jar handles it automatically for subsequent requests to the same host."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "CookieLogout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Auth/CookieLogout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Auth", "CookieLogout"]
            },
            "description": "Requires authentication (cookie or bearer). Ends the cookie session and revokes every active refresh token for the caller."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
