            "description": "Admin only. Polls the device over SNMP (port 161) and persists it. `typeOfNetworkDevice`: Huawei, Juniper, Extreme, Cisco, or FortiGate — full VLAN/port/ARP import currently only fully supports Juniper/Huawei/Extreme. Point `host` at a real router, or at a simulated one from docker-compose.snmp.yml — note the bundled `router-8.example.txt` dump only has a handful of system OIDs (enough for SNMPExecutor Get/Walk), so this request will 500 (\"empty results for ARP data\") against it; capture a full real dump (see SnmpSimulator/README.md) to actually exercise this endpoint."
